---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="pt-16 pb-16 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-32" id="get-started">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="lg:mb-20 text-center mb-16">
                <h2 class="lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight mb-6 font-manrope"
                    data-translate="howTo.title">How Payroll Works: 4 Simple Steps</h2>
                <p data-garna-subtitle class="text-xl font-light text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="howTo.description">For big companies, getting payroll right without facing errors is a major challenge. That's why we invented a system of several simple steps to make</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid xl:grid-cols-2 gap-x-16 gap-y-16 items-center">
                <div class="self-start z-0 relative space-y-10">
                    <div onclick="switchStep(0)"
                        class="step-trigger group relative pl-14 cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 opacity-100"
                        data-index="0">
                        <div class="-bottom-11 w-px bg-white/10 -z-10 absolute top-11 left-5"></div>
                        <h3 class="group-hover:text-[#CBF300] transition-colors text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step1.title">Set Up Your Team and Payroll Structure</h3>
                        <div
                            class="step-circle flex transition-all duration-300 z-10 text-sm font-semibold text-[#CBF300] bg-[#050505] w-10 h-10 border-[#CBF300] border rounded-full absolute top-1 left-0 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(203, 243, 0,0.3)] items-center justify-center font-sans">
                            1</div>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-manrope mt-3"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step1.description">Get your company set up with a bank account, assign roles to your payroll team, bring on board any new employees & contractors, and sort out all the entities and teams you need</p>
                    </div>

                    <div onclick="switchStep(1)"
                        class="step-trigger group cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 hover:opacity-80 opacity-50 pl-14 relative"
                        data-index="1">
                        <div class="absolute left-5 top-11 -bottom-11 w-px bg-white/10 -z-10"></div>
                        <div
                            class="step-circle flex transition-all duration-300 z-10 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 bg-[#050505] w-10 h-10 border-white/10 border rounded-full absolute top-1 left-0 items-center justify-center font-sans">
                            2</div>
                        <h3 class="group-hover:text-[#CBF300] transition-colors text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step2.title">Automate Calculations and Compliance</h3>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-manrope mt-3"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step2.description">Connect your dashboard via API and automate payroll tasks</p>
                    </div>

                    <div onclick="switchStep(2)"
                        class="step-trigger group cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 hover:opacity-80 opacity-50 pr-0 pl-14 relative left-0"
                        data-index="2">
                        <div class="-bottom-11 w-px bg-white/10 -z-10 absolute top-11 left-5"></div>
                        <div
                            class="step-circle flex transition-all duration-300 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 bg-[#050505] border border-white/10 w-10 h-10 z-10 rounded-full absolute top-1 left-0 items-center justify-center font-sans">
                            3</div>
                        <h3 class="group-hover:text-[#CBF300] transition-colors text-2xl font-normal text-white tracking-tight font-manrope"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step3.title">Run Payroll and Global Payments</h3>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-manrope mt-3 ml-0"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step3.description">Sort out funding and send payments to all your employees and contractors worldwide via payout methods from local bank transfers to SWIFT, SEPA, local bank transfers, PayPal, Payoneer or crypto</p>
                    </div>

                    <div onclick="switchStep(3)"
                        class="step-trigger group cursor-pointer transition-all duration-300 hover:opacity-80 opacity-50 pl-14 relative"
                        data-index="3">
                        <div
                            class="step-circle flex transition-all duration-300 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 bg-[#050505] border border-white/10 w-10 h-10 z-10 rounded-full absolute top-1 left-0 items-center justify-center font-sans">
                            4</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal text-white group-hover:text-[#CBF300] transition-colors tracking-tight font-manrope"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step4.title">Track, Report, and Scale</h3>
                        <p class="leading-relaxed text-base text-gray-500 font-manrope mt-3"
                            data-translate="howTo.steps.step4.description">Control payroll operations through a simple-to-use dashboard, access to real-time reporting and analytics, track down the cost of your workforce in every region</p>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <div class="relative w-full">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] shadow-2xl"></div>
                    <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] p-4">
                        <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
                            <div>
                                <p class="max-w-full truncate text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#CBF300]">Enterprise payroll workflow</p>
                                <h3 class="mt-2 max-w-full truncate text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight text-white font-manrope sm:text-xl">Global payroll operations board</h3>
                            </div>
                            <div class="max-w-[8rem] truncate rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/20 bg-[#CBF300]/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-[#CBF300]">4 steps active</div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-4 gap-2">
                            <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#CBF300]/20 bg-[#CBF300]/10 p-3">
                                <div class="mb-3 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/30 text-xs font-semibold text-[#CBF300]">1</div>
                                <div class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs font-semibold text-white sm:text-sm">Structure</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 min-w-0 truncate text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Entities and roles</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3">
                                <div class="mb-3 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/30 text-xs font-semibold text-[#CBF300]">2</div>
                                <div class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs font-semibold text-white sm:text-sm">Automate</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 min-w-0 truncate text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-500">API and rules</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3">
                                <div class="mb-3 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/30 text-xs font-semibold text-[#CBF300]">3</div>
                                <div class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs font-semibold text-white sm:text-sm">Pay</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 min-w-0 truncate text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Global methods</div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3">
                                <div class="mb-3 flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBF300]/30 text-xs font-semibold text-[#CBF300]">4</div>
                                <div class="min-w-0 truncate text-xs font-semibold text-white sm:text-sm">Scale</div>
                                <div class="mt-1 min-w-0 truncate text-[11px] leading-snug text-gray-500">Reports and cost</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-3 grid items-stretch gap-3 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]">
                            <div class="grid h-full gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 lg:flex lg:grid-cols-none lg:flex-col">
                                <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3">
                                    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gray-500">Team and payroll structure</span>
                                        <span class="text-xs text-[#CBF300]">Configured</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white font-manrope">6</div>
                                            <div class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-gray-500">Entities</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white font-manrope">14</div>
                                            <div class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-gray-500">Teams</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                            <div class="text-lg font-semibold text-white font-manrope">1.8k</div>
                                            <div class="mt-1 text-[11px] text-gray-500">Workers</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2.5">
                                            <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">Payroll admin</span>
                                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Finance HQ</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2.5">
                                            <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">Regional approver</span>
                                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">EU entities</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2.5">
                                            <span class="text-sm text-gray-300">HR lead</span>
                                            <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">Global team</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3">
                                    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gray-500">Payout rail</span>
                                        <span class="text-xs text-[#CBF300]">$1.84M ready</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-300">SWIFT</div>
                                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-300">SEPA</div>
                                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0A0A0A] px-3 py-2 text-center text-xs text-gray-300">Crypto</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10">
                                        <div class="h-full w-[78%] rounded-full bg-[#CBF300]"></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-gray-500">
                                        <span>Funding checked</span>
                                        <span>38 countries</span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="flex h-full flex-col gap-3">
                                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3 font-mono text-xs">
                                    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between font-sans">
                                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gray-500">Automation and compliance</span>
                                        <span class="text-xs text-[#CBF300]">Live</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                        <div class="text-gray-500">POST /payroll/runs</div>
                                        <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
                                            <div><span class="text-[#CBF300]">taxRules</span>: local</div>
                                            <div><span class="text-[#CBF300]">approvals</span>: role_based</div>
                                            <div><span class="text-[#CBF300]">reports</span>: real_time</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#111111] p-3 lg:flex-1">
                                    <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between">
                                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gray-500">Reporting and scale</span>
                                        <span class="text-xs text-[#CBF300]">Updated</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                            <div class="min-h-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-500">Payroll cost</div>
                                            <div class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white font-manrope">$4.2M</div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#0A0A0A] p-3">
                                            <div class="min-h-8 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gray-500">Exceptions</div>
                                            <div class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-white font-manrope">12</div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mt-auto flex h-16 items-end gap-2 pt-4">
                                        <div class="h-[35%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-white/10"></div>
                                        <div class="h-[52%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-white/10"></div>
                                        <div class="h-[44%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-white/10"></div>
                                        <div class="h-[68%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-[#CBF300]/40"></div>
                                        <div class="h-[84%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-[#CBF300]/70"></div>
                                        <div class="h-[96%] flex-1 rounded-t-lg bg-[#CBF300]"></div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
